    <h1 class="about-heading">ABOUT AURORA WATCH</h1>
    <div class="about-divider"></div>
    <p class="about-text">
      Hi! We are the team behind AURORA WATCH. We started to get interested in how to track
      these beautiful lightscapes so we are sharing our journey.
    </p>
    <p class="about-text">
      Aurora borealis and australis are among nature's most spectacular shows — and with the
      right tools and knowledge, you can predict when they might appear in your area. We built
      this site to make space weather data accessible to every sky watcher.
    </p>
    <p class="about-text">
      All data is sourced live from <a href="https://www.spaceweather.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NOAA's Space Weather Prediction Center</a>,
      the authoritative source for real-time geomagnetic and solar wind data.
    </p>
